     /*                                                                     */
     /*  22.12.2005  Th.Raddatz    Now using service program BASICS1.       */
     /*                                                                     */
     /*  07.02.2006  Th.Raddatz    Added outfile type *TYPE3 to support     */
     /*                            files with null-capable fields.          */
     /*                            Changed EXPJRNE to use RCVJRNE instead   */
